{% comment %}
  订单摘要卡（pages-ui §10 · task-cart T-1.3）。

  三条硬约束：
  1. **本 section 绝不输出任何金额形式的运费或税费**。主题无权计算（SDD §6.4），
     参考图里的「Shipping FREE」在本主题里属于伪造数据。只有一行静态文案。
  2. 空车时整节不输出——挂着 $0.00 的摘要卡是主题商店最常见的扣分点。
  3. 结账按钮靠 `form="cart-form"` 关联到 cart-lines 里的表单（跨 section，
     无法共用 <form> 元素）。改 id 时两处同步。

  加速结账（强制项 #3）：`content_for_additional_checkout_buttons` 输出的按钮
  **不加任何颜色/圆角覆盖**——官方要求不得修改其品牌配色。
{% endcomment %}

{%- if cart.item_count > 0 -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign summary_heading = section.settings.heading
    if summary_heading == blank
      assign summary_heading = 'cart.summary' | t
    endif

    assign summary_shipping_note = section.settings.shipping_note
    if cart.taxes_included
      assign summary_tax_note = 'cart.tax_included_note' | t
    else
      assign summary_tax_note = 'cart.shipping_note' | t
    endif
    assign summary_note = summary_shipping_note | default: summary_tax_note
  -%}

  <aside class="cart-summary" data-cart-section="{{ section.id }}" aria-labelledby="CartSummaryHeading">
    <h2 class="cart-summary__heading" id="CartSummaryHeading">{{ summary_heading | escape }}</h2>

    <dl class="cart-summary__rows">
      <div class="cart-summary__row">
        <dt>{{ 'cart.subtotal' | t }}</dt>
        <dd>{{ cart.items_subtotal_price | money }}</dd>
      </div>

      {%- if cart.total_discount > 0 -%}
        <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--discount">
          <dt>{{ 'cart.discount' | t }}</dt>
          <dd>−{{ cart.total_discount | money }}</dd>
        </div>
        {%- comment -%} 整单折扣逐条列出（强制项 #2）：只列有实际分摊金额的条目 {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications -%}
          {%- if discount.total_allocated_amount > 0 -%}
            <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--detail">
              <dt>{{ discount.title | escape }}</dt>
              <dd>−{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }}</dd>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    </dl>

    {%- comment -%}
      这一行是**文案**，不是计算结果。商家可在设置里改写，但设置项说明里写明了
      「不要填金额」——控制权交出去的同时把边界说清楚。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="cart-summary__note">{{ summary_note }}</p>

    <div class="cart-summary__total">
      <span>{{ 'cart.total' | t }}</span>
      <span class="cart-summary__total-value">{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      价格变化的播报区（WCAG / SDD §8.2）。脚本在局部刷新后把新总价写进来，
      文案模板由 Liquid 下发，前端不硬编码。
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-cart-live></p>

    <div class="cart-summary__actions">
      <button type="submit" name="checkout" form="cart-form" class="btn-solid cart-summary__checkout">
        {{- 'cart.checkout' | t -}}
      </button>

      {%- comment -%}
        加速结账默认启用、配色不动（强制项 #3）。平台在没有可用方式时输出空，
        这里不判断、不兜底——判断反而容易在编辑器里与预览不一致。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="cart-summary__accelerated">{{ content_for_additional_checkout_buttons }}</div>

      <a class="btn-solid btn-solid--quiet cart-summary__continue" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">
        {{- 'cart.continue_shopping' | t -}}
      </a>
    </div>

    {%- if section.settings.show_payment_icons and shop.enabled_payment_types.size > 0 -%}
      <div class="cart-summary__payment">
        {%- for type in shop.enabled_payment_types -%}
          {{ type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: 'cart-summary__payment-icon' }}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  </aside>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  .cart-summary {
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    background-color: var(--color-background);
  }

  .cart-summary__heading {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-block-end: 1rem;
  }

  .cart-summary__rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cart-summary__row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cart-summary__row dt,
  .cart-summary__row dd {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cart-summary__row--discount {
    color: var(--color-sale);
  }
  .cart-summary__row--detail {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    padding-inline-start: 0.75rem;
  }

  .cart-summary__note {
    margin-block: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
  }

  .cart-summary__total {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 0.85rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-foreground) 12%, transparent);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  .cart-summary__total-value {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
  }

  .cart-summary__actions {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.5rem;
  }
  .cart-summary__checkout,
  .cart-summary__continue {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    inline-size: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  /* 加速结账按钮由平台渲染，这里只统一间距，不碰颜色/形状 */
  .cart-summary__accelerated:empty {
    display: none;
  }
  .cart-summary__accelerated > * {
    display: block;
  }

  .cart-summary__payment {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    margin-block-start: 0.9rem;
  }
  .cart-summary__payment-icon {
    block-size: 22px;
    inline-size: auto;
  }

  /* 桌面吸顶。5.5rem 与产品页锚点导航的落点（88px）同一口径，
     意味着它正好让开吸住的页头；页头将来变高需要同步这个值。 */
  @media (min-width: 990px) {
    .cart-summary {
      position: sticky;
      inset-block-start: 5.5rem;
      max-block-size: calc(100svh - 6.5rem);
      overflow-y: auto;
    }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:sections.cart_summary.name",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "cart-summary-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_summary.labels.heading",
      "default": "t:sections.cart_summary.defaults.heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "shipping_note",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_summary.labels.shipping_note",
      "info": "t:sections.cart_summary.labels.shipping_note_info",
      "default": "t:sections.cart_summary.defaults.shipping_note"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_payment_icons",
      "label": "t:sections.cart_summary.labels.show_payment_icons",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "t:sections.cart_summary.name"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
